"maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/h0x91b-dev-3-0-db2751518d19.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"h0x91b/dev-3.0","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:09Z","updated_by_operation":"op_973b4389cf994776af37ef174df47cc5"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1a75e600a8d174b01e8417d29beed2efb89abedebe93efb8439bcdf7f527790a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A built-in review panel shows the branch diff with syntax highlighting, per-file read state, and inline comments on line ranges; the review can be copied back into the agent's terminal as a prompt."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2b49520b96d09c3fe167983b7424a0043603d7e82756bb84ada6553a2d41dade"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Windows support is described as brand new and possibly rough, and the Windows build is unsigned, so first launch requires clicking past a SmartScreen warning."},{"claim_ids":["clm_407f8a210c0d22558fdc78b7995515c043fc0065574672423902eff7e119f894"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Heavy directories like node_modules or .venv are copy-on-write cloned into task sandboxes, so sandboxes cost near-zero disk and appear instantly."},{"claim_ids":["clm_757103e44fff75f031ae78ceb942626a8112e2fa0a7f992eebcd2c954cefe9a7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The app is built on Electrobun (native webview, no Chromium) and Bun, with React 19 and Tailwind on the front end, ghostty-web for GPU-accelerated terminals, and tmux underneath."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8c64c03e98d5b5183fa224728e91ee6bf6bd02bd86728fb96649305d103da5c8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The app supports remote access via 'dev3 remote', serving the full UI to browsers over a Cloudflare tunnel, LAN, or SSH forward, with a QR code that keeps a phone connected for 8 hours."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d9d4bc56738749f5c02ee91a30f0759164bf29fb6de10db9b323c24e7ec3cbc0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"dev-3.0 is described as a Kanban board where each card is a live AI coding agent, with each task getting its own git worktree, terminal, and agent so many tasks run concurrently without file conflicts."},{"claim_ids":["clm_db011e3800e8c5a9c575578b7779a5fd37c86c26b947da69397f9c9a865232e5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product can launch read-only 'bug hunter' agents that comb a branch diff in parallel and report only provable findings, indicating a read-only agent mode."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dcdd6f98434b9798fcafeaa482e41c7d3b87adb3e4eaa28cb42d900937244a7a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Supported agents include Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor Agent, opencode, and any CLI tool the user configures; Claude Code and Codex report status via hooks while others use the installed dev3 skill."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e2e56770adc3e5ca02a7bf49017d47b68f53d00443216d63067b4c7c8aa6f38c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per-task sandboxes include a fresh git worktree off the base branch, a tmux session inside it, a per-project setup script, and optionally reserved free ports for the task's dev server."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e3021b11835e76709db59e70fd9d12877f61b719f74342decc73192e5d3d93b3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The dev3 CLI lets agents communicate with the board: setting task overviews, leaving notes, raising attention badges, showing images or HTML artifacts, starting peer tasks, and read-only peeking at other tasks' terminals."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1a75e600a8d174b01e8417d29beed2efb89abedebe93efb8439bcdf7f527790a","clm_2b49520b96d09c3fe167983b7424a0043603d7e82756bb84ada6553a2d41dade","clm_407f8a210c0d22558fdc78b7995515c043fc0065574672423902eff7e119f894","clm_757103e44fff75f031ae78ceb942626a8112e2fa0a7f992eebcd2c954cefe9a7","clm_8c64c03e98d5b5183fa224728e91ee6bf6bd02bd86728fb96649305d103da5c8","clm_d9d4bc56738749f5c02ee91a30f0759164bf29fb6de10db9b323c24e7ec3cbc0","clm_db011e3800e8c5a9c575578b7779a5fd37c86c26b947da69397f9c9a865232e5","clm_dcdd6f98434b9798fcafeaa482e41c7d3b87adb3e4eaa28cb42d900937244a7a","clm_e2e56770adc3e5ca02a7bf49017d47b68f53d00443216d63067b4c7c8aa6f38c","clm_e3021b11835e76709db59e70fd9d12877f61b719f74342decc73192e5d3d93b3"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:09Z","created_by_operation":"op_973b4389cf994776af37ef174df47cc5","id":"pg_d4181c1476825e1caeb315d8626886f0","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path